[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6620.47, "timestamp": "01:50:20", "text": "。很多東西，對吧？但是，如果我說"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6624.55, "timestamp": "01:50:24", "text": "如何應對"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6627.35, "timestamp": "01:50:27", "text": "這麼多人同時觀看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6637.229, "timestamp": "01:50:37", "text": "你並讓他們感到愉悅，所有這些事情，對吧？嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6653.109, "timestamp": "01:50:53", "text": "，我認為最終，與其過於關注如何讓每個人都滿意，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6655.51, "timestamp": "01:50:55", "text": "不如明白"}]